<title>USA: Baldwin Piano names president/CEO chairman.</title>
<headline>Baldwin Piano names president/CEO chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LOVELAND, Ohio 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baldwin Piano &amp; Organ Co said Tuesday it has named President and Chief Executive Karen Hendricks chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Hendricks succeeds R.S. Harrison, who had been chairman since 1984. The company said in a statement that Harrison said that after 41 years at Baldwin, &quot;he felt it was time to move on.&quot;</p>
<p>Harrison served as chief executive from 1984 to 1994.</p>
